      "side": 1,
      "message": "Lets move this until after we know we have a problem.  Today, and in the design doc platform-init is a single executable.  Clearly you have designs to change that, which is great to discuss, but lets stack up the new applications ahead of trying to invent a new folder structure until after we know we need it.\n\nSaid another way, at this time, there\u0027s one binary.  There\u0027s no reason for a subfolder.\n\nI suspect this patch can be abandoned for now.",
      "revId": "18770b8c0224f484fc12c51cd496e9684e462f9b",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
