      },
      "lineNbr": 14,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000000
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-06-01T16:16:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This change makes it more in line with the documented approaches in https://github.com/openbmc/docs/blob/master/anti-patterns.md#incorrect-placement-of-executables-in-sbin-usrsbin-or-bin-usrbin\n\n\u003e Executables of type 1 should not be placed anywhere in ${PATH} because it is confusing and error-prone to users, but should instead be placed in a /usr/libexec/\u003cpackage\u003e subdirectory.\n\nI think this commit can go to the _front_ of the stack with that in mind.",
      "parentUuid": "3ee93a2f_06f9d6f9",
      "revId": "18770b8c0224f484fc12c51cd496e9684e462f9b",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "2b438474_1aa98102",
        "filename": "/COMMIT_MSG",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 14,
