        "id": 1000153
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-06-01T16:20:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is arguably type 1 and type 2 given it has a CLI that can be executed by a shell, so by that, this should be going in the /bin PATH, right?\n\nI didn\u0027t want to dive that deep because that\u0027s subtle, and didn\u0027t want to have a debate in a simple MR.\n\nI was hoping that later patches would lend some light to why we were trying to put a folder here and drive some clarity, but sure, if we want to go through it here, we can.",
      "parentUuid": "280f925c_642e3e93",
      "revId": "18770b8c0224f484fc12c51cd496e9684e462f9b",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "59c6967e_efee82c5",
        "filename": "/COMMIT_MSG",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 14,
