      },
      "lineNbr": 14,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000000
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-06-01T16:52:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Isn\u0027t it still just a daemon / single command invoked from a systemd.service?\n\n```\n$ ./builddir/platform --help   \nPlatform init CLI\n\n\n./builddir/platform [OPTIONS] SUBCOMMANDS\n\n\nOPTIONS:\n  -h,     --help              Print this help message and exit\n\nSUBCOMMANDS:\n  init                        Initialize the platform and daemonize\n```\n\nI\u0027ve tried to move as much as I can easily out of `${bindir}` because it makes tab-complete worse for things that are never going to be ran by humans.",
      "parentUuid": "47c509b3_f3bd3b12",
      "revId": "18770b8c0224f484fc12c51cd496e9684e462f9b",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
    },
    {
